    "PROPOSED, NOT GENERATED. This file was written by hand from a reading",
    "of the source. No tool produced it and nothing verified it against a",
    "built extension module, so it states the intended shape of the",
    "snapshot rather than a checked fact about the tree. The generator,",
    "the pixi task, the CI job, and the exports the generator needs are",
    "specified in handoffs/task20_compatibility.md. Once that tool exists,",
    "its output replaces this file wholesale and `status` becomes",
    "\"generated\".",
    "Absence of a name here is not evidence the name is absent from the",
    "code. It may be evidence that the hand pass missed it."
